0..49 Comment "// A record face is a named set of record labels."
50..52 Comment "//"
53..130 Comment "// A `where` block declares faces after a record type. A static bracket fixes"
131..183 Comment "// fields by label, by face or by a system of faces."
184..186 Comment "//"
187..266 Comment "// The checker checks each fixed value at its field type. A patched value keeps"
267..343 Comment "// its free fields. A selection returns a fixed value. A record type ends at"
344..423 Comment "// `}` and keeps its labels as its boundary without a block. `|->` spells `↦`"
424..436 Comment "// in ASCII."
437..439 Comment "//"
440..518 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/record-faces.gandr` — a face past the labels, a"
519..594 Comment "//   face named twice, a bracket naming a field or a face the type lacks, a"
595..666 Comment "//   literal stating a fixed field at another value, and two faces that"
667..703 Comment "//   disagree on their meet, refused"
704..783 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s `boundary` and its"
784..794 Comment "//   faces"
